{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": [\n        \"S05-1\"\n      ],\n      \"beads\": [\n        \"B1.1\",\n        \"B1.2\"\n      ],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"亲近曾经真实而温暖，所以此刻音乐转向克制、亲密的低声交谈；他并非已经放下，而是不甘心让这份亲近只剩回忆。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": [],\n      \"beads\": [\n        \"B5.1\",\n        \"B5.2\",\n        \"B5.3\"\n      ],\n      \"alt\": true,\n      \"note\": \"也可以听成：旧日记忆重新有了温度，可能指向某个人、故乡或过去的生活；但因为这一切已经过去，眷恋也带着失落。这是替代 B1 的另一种听法，不进入线的因果故事。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": [\n        \"S05-1\",\n        \"S05-2\"\n      ],\n      \"beads\": [\n        \"B2.1\",\n        \"B2.2\",\n        \"B2.3\"\n      ],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"不甘心让亲近只留在回忆里，使柔和的歌唱仍然带着向前的劲；这份不甘逐渐化作直接的抗拒，愤怒、悲伤与维护自己的意愿同时存在。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": [\n        \"S05-2\"\n      ],\n      \"beads\": [\n        \"B3.1\",\n        \"B3.2\",\n        \"B3.3\",\n        \"B4.1\",\n        \"B4.3\"\n      ],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"128小节后，持续向前的运动逐渐减弱，旋律在128–129及139–144小节几乎独自露出，仿佛失去了脚下的支撑；然而，132小节后躁动与不安仍在加深，声音变稀疏并不意味着心里平静。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": [\n        \"S05-2\"\n      ],\n      \"beads\": [\n        \"B4.2\",\n        \"B4.4\"\n      ],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"到144–147小节，音乐才像经过几次深呼吸般短暂松开；这不是隔阂消失或他终于想通了，而是持续抵抗之后，力气暂时耗尽。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"explains\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"beads\": [\n        \"B1\",\n        \"B2\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"亲近曾经真实温暖过他，解释了为何音乐转向克制而亲密的低声交谈；不甘心让这份亲近只剩回忆，也为柔和歌唱底下仍然存在的推进力与“不能就这样算了”的坚持提供了动机。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"beads\": [\n        \"B2\",\n        \"B3\",\n        \"B4\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"不甘转化为急切抗拒，对应B2中更直接的宣告感与复杂情绪；心里的隔阂仍在，解释了B3中旋律孤立、支撑感减弱的听感；抵抗最终因力竭而暂缓，则贯穿B4中躁动未平到短暂松弛的变化。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B5.1\",\n      \"why\": \"这颗珠子把听感解释为旧日记忆重新变暖，与B1所呈现的当下亲密交谈是两种不能同时成立的听法，不属于S05-1与S05-2所构成的因果故事。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B5.2\",\n      \"why\": \"对某个人、故乡或过去生活的指向，是另一种听法提出的可能对象，线中并未提供足以确定这些对象的经历依据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B5.3\",\n      \"why\": \"这颗珠子将失落归因于记忆所指向的事物已经过去，属于替代听法的情感逻辑，而非线所讲述的亲近引发不甘、抗拒持续到力竭的过程。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f5248c3e-6ea9-441d-9807-51feca0be525", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T084310866744Z", "elapsed_seconds": 134.171, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T08:45:25.036368+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "60db1dd0d93caafadb7dbbacfee8edd84f06ad6125db955ca4f950b9ab65dfeb", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T084310866744Z", "files": ["proof-offline.p